  displayName: The Water Clock
  description: The observatory keeps time by water, and the water keeps to pipes.
    Something has turned every joint in the works. Turn them back — but the pipes
    are your own blocks, and a block swings its whole body when it turns, so the
    trouble is as much about room as it is about routing.
  status: Turn the works back — one round at a time
